<title>UK: UK gilt auction announcement -- full details.</title>
<headline>UK gilt auction announcement -- full details.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following issue was announced by the Bank of England</p>
<p>ISSUER: H M Treasury</p>
<p>AMOUNT: 2.0 bln</p>
<p>COUPON: 7.25 percent</p>
<p>MATURITY: 2007</p>
<p>AUCTION DATE: June 25</p>
<p>NOTES: The issue is fully paid and fungible with stock already in issue and will be strippable when the offical gilts strip facility is introduced. When-issued trading begins from now.</p>
<p>-- London newsroom +44 171 542 7715</p>
</text>
